/-!
# Cumulative universe-tower presentation

This is the umbrella import for one cumulative universe-tower presentation
currently investigated by Prime.  Its mathematical identity is the explicit
level algebra, the shared Pi/Sigma/identity grammar, the cumulative tower, and
the constructions derived from them.  Importing this module does not select it
as Prime's final or exclusive type theory; Prime remains a client that may
combine, refine, or replace this presentation through explicit bridges.

The development exposes:

* an exact decidable algebra of universe levels;
* disjoint sealed-Legacy and cumulative-Tower presentations;
* the exact sealed conservativity frontier and its raw-syntax counterexample;
* structural and typed substitution, including context-comprehension laws;
* one declaration-aware typing spine, with proof-carrying signatures,
  monotone extension, exact empty-signature recovery, and a proved
  correspondence to the former declaration calculus;
* the category of declaration-aware well-formed contexts and typed
  substitutions, with constructive terminal empty context, type and term
  reindexing, and the full context-comprehension beta/eta laws;
* the represented syntactic natural model of generalized elements, with
  intrinsically indexed variables and substitution-stable dependent products,
  dependent sums, and identity types; introduction and elimination construct
  judgments directly, while beta remains proof-relevant formed-endpoint
  conversion rather than host-language equality, including explicit type
  transport for the dependent second projection; a displayed-universe
  refinement makes every conversion intermediate intrinsically typed and
  proves that forgetting this evidence commutes with typed substitution;
  the declaration-aware
  fixed-left identity eliminator and its authored iota witness embed as a
  substitution-stable native cell in the same judgmental natural model;
* a scoped Russell/generated-Tarski presentation boundary, extended by typed
  contextual templates for open families, with the generated grammar proved
  to be exactly the zero-template fragment;
* proof-relevant judgment-indexed computation and conversion evidence, with
  raw declaration equations admitted only through explicit preservation;
  authored/native receipt comparison is separately required to be natural in
  renaming and simultaneous substitution before it transports complete typed
  occurrences, a capability proved for List/identity and both candidate views
  of the shared Nat/Vec declaration world without postulating a universal
  conversion checker; the authored and native receipt relations are mutually
  inverse equipment cells, and their renaming/substitution naturality laws are
  equalities of composed proof-relevant cells;
* generic open algebraic schemas, parallel reduction, and occurrence-separated
  presentations whose fibre evidence may retain proof-relevant conversion
  receipts; exact nonlinear Prime iota schemas are related conservatively to
  their left-linear occurrence geometry, while the remaining Church--Rosser
  choice is exposed by a machine-checked negative control rather than assumed;
* explicit polymorphic functional composition and Church-list map derivations;
* proof-relevant `Rel` and witness-retaining relational `Chain`, whose
  proof-family interpretation is exactly the GSLT-IL loose-arrow equipment;
* a universe-polymorphic MIL chain metarule and an indexed hypothesis space
  in which learned relational programs retain their intermediate witnesses
  and ill-sorted predicate substitutions are unconstructible;
* the same hypothesis space as a genuinely native strictly-positive indexed
  family with dependent elimination, proof-relevant computation receipts,
  and exact quotation of typed semantic hypothesis programs;
* a structural exact-image semantics connecting those quoted programs to
  intrinsic typing and proof-relevant relations, with non-unique semantic
  reflection exposed by a checked collision;
* direct-map compilation derived only for programs whose primitive relations
  are representable, while raw nondeterministic primitives remain executable
  and provably unlicensed;
* exact finite proof-fibre enumeration as the stronger native-search
  capability for relational programs, closed under witness-retaining chain
  and admitted revision-sensitively without making raw relations functional;
* a common displayed checked-native waist separating structural derivations,
  independent semantic evidence, exact raw-proof identity, and native
  artifacts: retained graphs are always evidence-faithful, while faithfulness
  of artifact projection is an earned injectivity capability whose failure is
  witnessed by a checked collision;
* one fixed-alphabet, declaration-aware Prime data presentation with an exact
  intrinsic codec and a recursive structural typing calculus; its native
  world carries context-formation evidence once, so an unformed but
  canonically encoded raw derivation cannot cross the checked-native waist;
  universal raw semantic fibres are separated from positive native fibres,
  canonical-premise closure characterizes when root support is sufficient,
  and the general nodewise canonical derivation validates every hidden
  premise exactly once while retaining the identical raw proof tree;
  dependent-function formation retains both premise derivations across the
  telescope extension and computes the explicit maximum universe, while a
  malformed arity/context instance demonstrates why unrestricted schema
  replay is strictly weaker than intrinsic reflection;
* declaration-aware typed conversion as one further exact root judgment,
  retaining context formation, common-type formation, both endpoint typings,
  and every conversion receipt; the generic presentation earns a reflexive
  checked image, while the native Pi kernel constructs nontrivial beta in the
  same intrinsic family and is proved strictly richer, and an untyped beta
  step with an ill-typed argument cannot mint typed conversion evidence;
* an ordered authored declaration language whose exact GSLT elaboration keeps
  bundle order, complete equation schemas, substitution history, and duplicate
  equation-occurrence identity; its interpretation into the extensional
  first-wins signature is proved noninjective rather than mistaken for source
  reconstruction;
* declaration-hosted intrinsic judgments indexed by that authored world,
  separating mere declaration formation from licensed computation, embedding
  every bare checked judgment conservatively, and allowing a formed declared
  constant without postulating a universal declaration checker;
* exact source-faithful nominal ingress: a proof-relevant walk selects the
  first authored constant occurrence, retains its precise source position,
  is equivalent to extensional signature lookup in both directions, and
  constructs the corresponding hosted Prime judgment, while a later shadowed
  declaration is provably unable to acquire authority;
* executable source-generated inference ingress: a finite proof-carrying
  inventory emits one ground fact for every active first-wins constant and
  passes through the ordinary V2 extension validator; every accepted fact
  reflects to its exact source occurrence, index, and displayed type, while a
  one-node active proof is accepted and every proof tree for a shadowed
  declaration is rejected;
* source-generated equation ingress with two independent occurrence coordinates:
  the complete source position survives interleaved constants, the filtered
  equation position survives duplicate endpoints, every accepted ground fact
  reflects to that exact authored occurrence, and a fact forged at a constant
  position is rejected; generic Pattern instantiation is proved unable to
  impersonate object-level de Bruijn substitution;
* the corresponding maximal-native bridge: an authenticated equation is
  instantiated by Prime simultaneous substitution and, with endpoint typing,
  constructs the existing proof-relevant typed-conversion fibre; uniform
  preservation derives target typing from source typing, native receipts decode
  to the exact source occurrence and substitution, and an authenticated schema
  with a raw ill-typed List instance cannot acquire typed computation authority;
* the exact checked/native boundary into every declaration host: the fixed
  formed-typing presentation transports checked ingress conservatively, while
  every genuinely declared constant is a strict native inhabitant outside the
  fixed bare checker image, making source-generated checking and maximal native
  construction complementary rather than competing authorities;
* an exact authored source document for the native List and identity package:
  a generic finite authored inventory derives the source interpretation from
  constant lookup equality and receipt-fibre equivalence rather than accepting
  an independent signature-equality field; its GSLT elaboration interprets to
  the existing formed signature, and its
  indexed equation occurrences are fibrewise equivalent to the native
  proof-relevant iota realization, retaining schema identity, the complete
  substitution, and every eliminator argument; support erasure is proved
  noninjective, and promotion from the resulting formation host to a
  computational host still requires the separate iota-preservation family,
  without reconstructing source from the optimized signature;
* the authored-family interpretation as a proof-relevant GSLT-IL route: its
  retained elaboration inventory is represented exactly by the direct semantic
  interpretation map, while the converse source-world relation is provably not
  representable because extensional signatures forget authored distinctions;
  the native List/identity document supplies a concrete positive route;
* a generic constructional typed-conversion bridge for every such authored
  family: an indexed equation occurrence enters native computation together
  with both endpoint typings, retains its exact native receipt as a
  judgment-indexed conversion step, and projects explicitly to declared
  logical support; uniform declaration preservation derives the target typing
  once from the typed source, while raw ill-typed List and Nat occurrences are
  proved unable to enter the typed fibre, so native computation requires no
  interior replay by the generic checker;
* an automatically generated constructional family kernel from typed canonical
  schemas: typed substitution produces new steps while retaining the exact
  authored schema position, source substitution, both endpoint derivations,
  and native receipt; complete conversion trees realize structurally into the
  existing native computation without replay; List/identity and both Nat and
  Vec views of their shared declaration world instantiate the interface, while
  arbitrary raw equation closure remains correctly conditional on a separate
  preservation theorem;
* an exact-image bridge from every generic-checker derivation of a learned
  relational goal into the native indexed hypothesis family over a formed
  declaration context, retaining the identical raw proof and relational
  evidence; an inhabited grandparent quotation and rejected wrong-middle
  proof witness both sides of the boundary;
* a second exact-image bridge for recursive higher-order `mapRel` proofs:
  every accepted successor-List derivation constructs the corresponding
  genuinely native indexed-family inhabitant over a formed `A,B,R` context,
  while exact raw erasure and every head/tail evidence occurrence are retained
  and a proof missing its recursive child has no native image;
* generic compositional relation lifting as a capability of data formers,
  with native List proved to preserve identities and proof-relevant chains,
  and the former List-specific higher-order hypotheses recovered exactly;
* occurrence-bag bind as the engine realization of `Chain`, with truth support
  and evidence-strength loss made explicit;
* level-parametric declaration instantiation, with lookup, typing, and root
  computation transported through one reusable signature operation;
* an intrinsic universe-generic native `List.map` term and a genuinely
  proof-relevant indexed `mapRel` family, including strict positivity, a
  dependent eliminator, and exact typed nil/cons computation receipts;
  on the canonical constructor fragment, actual typed raw elements and
  relation witnesses fold to those intrinsic terms with proved typing and
  are exactly equivalent to the polynomial List/relator semantics;
* the exact native-List representation seam to runtime expression
  `cons-atom`/`decons-atom`, kept separate from the later cost theorem;
* native Peano naturals and length-indexed vectors as a second, genuinely
  indexed realization of the generic positive-family interface, including
  dependent eliminators and proof-relevant iota receipts; one finite authored
  declaration inventory presents both the Nat and Vec candidate views, with an
  exact four-schema receipt equivalence and an ill-typed raw-step negative;
* first-class validated presentation values and relational typed routes, with
  representability as the earned compiled-map license;
* companion and conjoint binding cells for every represented tight map,
  including both triangle laws and identity/composition coherence;
* occurrence-bearing free route paths and exact coherent compilation to
  strict internal wire paths, while ambiguous elaboration remains relational
  and is proved not representable by one global command function;
* the exact returned-fibre internal-language theorem and its strict
  out-of-image transport boundary;
* compositional observation transport along represented GSLT-IL execution
  paths, without claiming that lossy observations reflect path identity;
* the exact fibre-factorization criterion for arbitrary downstream policies,
  and preservation/reflection of policy support along represented routes;
* compositional policy support for parallel observation disciplines, with a
  checked counterexample showing that a constant axis cannot repair a lost
  distinction;
* the exact policy-specific observation criterion for maximum selection,
  including a lossy work-only readout that supports work selection but is
  proved insufficient for span selection;
* preservation and reflection of that policy-sufficiency criterion along
  represented GSLT-IL routes, coherently with route composition;
* the exact universal property of capability-generated observation domains:
  they are the least declared domains containing every accepted history and
  closed under the supplied chronological and proof-relevantly authorized
  independent-parallel operations; this least-domain characterization is
  preserved by represented GSLT-IL route pullback at independently varying
  container, value, and authority universes; an explicit model proves that
  licensed parallel construction can strictly extend raw history reachability,
  while an empty authorization family cannot mint that extension even through
  an arbitrarily nested pulled construction tree;
* an evidence-bearing outcome sum with distinct budget and authority
  refinement axes, and operational faults outside the semantic carrier;
* a strictly-positive, type-valued internal model of authority outcomes,
  runs, receipts, and both refinement witnesses, with exact equivalences to
  the external Lean contracts, together with intrinsic first-class Outcome,
  Run, and provenance-bearing Receipt declarations, dependent eliminators,
  strict-positivity witnesses, exact typed computation receipts, and explicit
  negative recursive-domain controls; a native empty family and first-class
  Authority records retain positive and negative soundness maps, with their
  incompatibility witnessed internally rather than flattened to a Boolean;
  budget and authority refinement are fibres of one intrinsic axis-indexed
  family with ten proof-relevant legal transitions, a dependent eliminator,
  exact computation receipts, exact external fibre models, and mixed histories
  that retain both their intermediate outcomes and the order of improvement;
* the native CeTTa correspondence and occurrence-bag gate obligations; and
* a sound, budget-monotone executable authority on the exact eight-row
  tower-boundary image.

Importing this module supplies theory and proof interfaces only.  It does not
install a native implementation as semantic authority.  The proved
internal-language result is exact on the returned-fibre image; it is not a
claim of semantic-CwF initiality or a universal property for the full command
language.  Those stronger statements remain machine-visible open boundaries.
-/
